    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this round-based 2.5D puzzle platformer, you solve puzzles by repeating the same level with each character and their special abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Tamo, Mukao and Cenali on their Adventure and help them face the consequences of their own actions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character you want to start with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/81c970fc8d72cb3cb3a672a1118f7254.poster.avif?t=1741106110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/81c970fc8d72cb3cb3a672a1118f7254.webm?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/81c970fc8d72cb3cb3a672a1118f7254.mp4?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the characters have a unique set of abilities that will help you to navigate through the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7f185cb4c566f3dec30fc976f61e9e1e.poster.avif?t=1741106110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7f185cb4c566f3dec30fc976f61e9e1e.webm?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7f185cb4c566f3dec30fc976f61e9e1e.mp4?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when you use your abilities. They might help you now but could stop you in the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7117b966e1d825de30ae9bf48514ba89.poster.avif?t=1741106110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7117b966e1d825de30ae9bf48514ba89.webm?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7117b966e1d825de30ae9bf48514ba89.mp4?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only when finishing the level with each character, can you progress through the temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/6136696d04f40abdcea48419830f2d56.poster.avif?t=1741106110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/6136696d04f40abdcea48419830f2d56.webm?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/6136696d04f40abdcea48419830f2d56.mp4?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this round-based 2.5D puzzle platformer, you solve puzzles by repeating the same level with each character and their special abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Tamo, Mukao and Cenali on their Adventure and help them face the consequences of their own actions!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose the character you want to start with. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/81c970fc8d72cb3cb3a672a1118f7254.poster.avif?t=1741106110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/81c970fc8d72cb3cb3a672a1118f7254.webm?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/81c970fc8d72cb3cb3a672a1118f7254.mp4?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the characters have a unique set of abilities that will help you to navigate through the level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7f185cb4c566f3dec30fc976f61e9e1e.poster.avif?t=1741106110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7f185cb4c566f3dec30fc976f61e9e1e.webm?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7f185cb4c566f3dec30fc976f61e9e1e.mp4?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful when you use your abilities. They might help you now but could stop you in the next run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7117b966e1d825de30ae9bf48514ba89.poster.avif?t=1741106110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7117b966e1d825de30ae9bf48514ba89.webm?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/7117b966e1d825de30ae9bf48514ba89.mp4?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only when finishing the level with each character, can you progress through the temple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/6136696d04f40abdcea48419830f2d56.poster.avif?t=1741106110\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/6136696d04f40abdcea48419830f2d56.webm?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504610/extras/6136696d04f40abdcea48419830f2d56.mp4?t=1741106110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
